#: ../../source/docs/modules/ntrip.rst:3 903ac77c729c45659a69bb3b63a415b0
msgid "NTRIP Injection"
msgstr "NTRIP 注入"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ntrip.rst:9 9b66a29585bd47dd922f0682bc75c1a2
msgid ""
"Connects to an NTRIP (GPS RTK correction) server and passes the correction "
"messages to ArduPilot. This would allow a (compatible) GPS module to receive"
" RTCM corrections."
msgstr ""
"连接到 NTRIP（GPS RTK 差分）服务器并将差分消息传递给 ArduPilot，使（兼容的）GPS 模块能够接收 RTCM 差分数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ntrip.rst:12 1dd9359d7d334f9cb9132e6d4c1a14f3
msgid ""
"Use ``ntrip start`` to start sending correction data and ``ntrip stop`` to "
"stop sending correction data."
msgstr "使用 ``ntrip start`` 开始发送差分数据，``ntrip stop`` 停止发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/ntrip.rst:15 380285b7dd6a44e1ae15bfda5a92a9a3
msgid "To see the current status, use ``ntrip status``."
msgstr "使用 ``ntrip status`` 查看当前状态。"

